{"availability":"available","full":"souskai/agency-web","name":"agency-web","description":"Agency website template — Next.js 16, Payload CMS 3.x, TailwindCSS v4, PostgreSQL, Vercel-optimized","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-08T15:28:43Z","updated":"2026-10-06T08:46:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://agency-web-iota.vercel.app","topics":["agency","nextjs","payloadcms","postgresql","tailwindcss","typescript","vercel"],"demo":"https://payloadcms.com/docs/live-preview/overview","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:54.265Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:54.265Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:45:54.265Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:45:54.265Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Built on top of the official Payload Website Template.","This template extends the upstream Payload starter with everything a digital agency (or similar service business) needs out of the box. The original README has been updated to reflect the additions — you still get all of the stock Payload features, plus the agency-specific collections, blocks, globals, and seed data described below."],"features":["Next.js 16 + Turbopack — Uses the latest App Router features including use cache directives, on-demand revalidation, and React Server Components for fast, production-grade rendering.","Optimized for Vercel — Pre-configured for Vercel Postgres (@payloadcms/db-vercel-postgres), Vercel Blob Storage, and cron-based scheduled publishing. Deploys with zero additional infrastructure.","Modern styling stack — TailwindCSS v4, shadcn/ui components, and a centralized font config. All visual styling is intentionally minimal so you can adapt it to your own brand.","Agency-ready collections — Adds Customers, Technologies, Team Members, Testimonials, Services, Case Studies, Awards, Legal Pages, Demos, and Portfolio on top of the stoc